    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Pony AI Inc. describes itself as a leading global autonomous driving technology company, founded in 2016 in Silicon Valley. The company says it aims to bring safe, sustainable, and accessible mobility worldwide, and that it has accumulated millions of kilometers in autonomous road testing in complex scenarios. Its autonomous driving vehicles have traveled over 32 million kilometers (over 13 million miles) on urban roads and highways as of April 2024. Pony AI states it has secured licenses and credentials to test and operate autonomous driving vehicles in multiple locations across the world.\n\nThe company positions its core technology, which it calls a \"virtual driver,\" across three business units: Robotaxi, Robotruck, and Personally Owned Vehicles (POV). It describes itself as an industry leader in the commercialization of autonomous driving and says it is committed to developing the safest autonomous driving capabilities on a global scale.\n\nPony AI Inc. is a for-profit public company with ticker PONY and CIK 0001969302, headquartered in Guangzhou, F4. No litigation is recorded in the available facts.",
